  ],
  "date": "2026-11-10",
  "model": "Claude Opus 5.5",
  "notes": "Exact distance d_X = d_Z = 6: tropidist (arXiv:2611.08247) at the board's pinned commit b03ec2d4077f closes both sides (certs/936-470-6.json, level solver); independently two exact programs for check matrices with column weight 2 and an enumeration of all circuits of length <= 6 (26364 X-type and 26364 Z-type logical operators of weight 6, none lighter), see the research note. Novelty: no board entry with these n and k at commit 8042f9da; parameters not found in Breuckmann and Terhal (arXiv:1506.04029), Breuckmann et al. (arXiv:1703.00590), Breuckmann's thesis (arXiv:1802.01520), Mahmoud and Rayan (arXiv:2610.10948), Breuckmann and Burton (arXiv:2202.06647), Mahmoud, Ali and Rayan (arXiv:2504.07800), the catalogs of QEC-pages (Quantum_LDPC_Codes) and qecdb.org; Conder's lists contain the map, not the code. Equivalence with existing entries: checked, none has these n and k."
